# binomial prediction P[Bin(m,pi) > m-l] at the measured m only.
# m-l = floor(rho(m+1))-1 steps by one every 1/rho queries, so the
# prediction is a sawtooth in m; evaluating it at the same m as the
# measurement compares like with like.
# Quora/Qwen ef=1024 pi=0.00423
100 0.3457
200 0.2080
400 0.0918
800 0.0224
1600 0.0017
3000 0.0000


